.TH "wavetraveler-by-francoischazal" "6" "2026-11-20" "Wave Traveler User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
wavetraveler-by-francoischazal - run the Wave Traveler 4k intro
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
wavetraveler-by-francoischazal
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Wave Traveler is a 4k intro released by Francois Chazal in 2004.
After a small loading screen, it shows wavelength interferences computed
in real time, in a 400x300 window.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.PP
Press any key, or close the window, to quit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\f[B]SDL12COMPAT_SYNC_TO_VBLANK\f[R]
The animation advances by one step per frame, so it is synchronised to
the vertical blank by default.
Set this variable to 0 to disable it.
.SH INFOS
.PP
https://320x200.org/2004/4k/
.SH BUGS
.PP
No known bugs.
